      <p><seg source="#source-280-318">美しい王子様のおせなかに</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-318-347">まつかなマントが</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-347-380">ゆれてゐるかな</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-380-418">美しい王子様のおん馬車の</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-418-441">馬が青い空を</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-447-462"><rb>眺</rb><rt>なが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-462-480">めてゐるかな</seg></p>
    </body>
